# Stunt mode played to the end of its timer (pak flow): SELECT MODE DOWN x4 (STUNT), then the accelerator held
# with some steering until the 4:40 stunt timer runs out (race start ~22.5 s + 280 s), then A presses through
# whatever follows (results / name entry / replay prompt). Written for the call census (w27r): the 60-90 s race
# scripts never finish a race, so results and end-of-race code is unreached by them.
frames 11000
pak on
4 START
7 A
10 A
12 DOWN
13 DOWN
14 DOWN
15 DOWN
16 A
19 A
22 A
25 A 275
40 STICKLEFT 2
80 STICKRIGHT 2
120 STICKLEFT 2
160 STICKRIGHT 2
200 STICKLEFT 2
240 STICKRIGHT 2
305 A
310 A
315 A
320 A
325 START
330 A
335 A
340 A
345 B
350 A
355 A
